    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an independent journalist who sets out to investigate a mysterious, abandoned construction site that was suddenly and inexplicably shut down. No one knows the full story \u2014 and it\u2019s up to you to uncover the truth.<br><br>As you explore the dark, eerie environment, you\u2019ll search for clues scattered throughout the site. Discover written notes, audio recordings, and other remnants left behind by workers to piece together the events that led to the abandonment.<br><br>Gameplay features:<br>\u2022 Exploration-focused gameplay in a creepy, atmospheric setting<br>\u2022 Puzzle-solving that requires attention to detail and logic<br>\u2022 Narrative clues hidden in notes and voice-acted audio logs<br>\u2022 Story-driven experience with light horror elements and no combat<br><br>Silent Street is a short but immersive horror experience built around mystery, tension, and unraveling a forgotten story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an independent journalist who sets out to investigate a mysterious, abandoned construction site that was suddenly and inexplicably shut down. No one knows the full story \u2014 and it\u2019s up to you to uncover the truth.<br><br>As you explore the dark, eerie environment, you\u2019ll search for clues scattered throughout the site. Discover written notes, audio recordings, and other remnants left behind by workers to piece together the events that led to the abandonment.<br><br>Gameplay features:<br>\u2022 Exploration-focused gameplay in a creepy, atmospheric setting<br>\u2022 Puzzle-solving that requires attention to detail and logic<br>\u2022 Narrative clues hidden in notes and voice-acted audio logs<br>\u2022 Story-driven experience with light horror elements and no combat<br><br>Silent Street is a short but immersive horror experience built around mystery, tension, and unraveling a forgotten story.</p>",
    "short_description": "You are an independent journalist drawn to a mysterious, abandoned housing development. Explore the eerie street, uncover hidden clues, and solve puzzles to reveal the dark truth behind its sudden stop. A short, atmospheric horror experience with tension, mystery, and jump scares.",
